Training-only synthetic mixture: low-K=35%, procedural-shape=25%, historical=40%; procedural shapes have no true-knot/count labels; validation distribution is unchanged.
Real sources are VALIDATION ONLY; training uses labeled synthetic splines and unlabeled procedural shapes, and test splits are excluded from model selection.
